cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Decision Experimentation Kernel"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Ashutosh Kumar"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TubeCorner/decision-experimentation-kernel"
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  A small Python framework for decision experimentation and decision evaluation
  across cases: preserving contradictory outcomes, supporting and opposing
  evidence, failure analysis, applicability conditions, and scoped hypotheses.
  Currently demonstrated in editorial, audit, and operations examples; not a
  claim of universal applicability.
keywords:
  - decision experimentation
  - decision evaluation
  - contradictory outcomes
  - failure analysis
  - scoped hypotheses
  - evidence
license: MIT
